<title>USA: U.S. soybean oil export breakdown.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean oil export breakdown.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department breakdown of soybean oil exports (tonnes):</p>
<p> -		     July96   June96   July95</p>
<p> -	   Crude    5,338    2,564   18,279</p>
<p> -  Once Refined    1,118	 31	263</p>
<p> - Fully Refined    4,716    4,638   22,018</p>
<p> -  Hydrogenated    1,142	 72    3,714</p>
<p> -	   Total   12,314    7,305   43,273</p>
